<title>USA: AnnTaylor Stores stake cut by Cygne.</title>
<headline>AnnTaylor Stores stake cut by Cygne.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cygne Designs Inc said Tuesday it cut its stake in AnnTaylor Stores Corp to 1,506,645 common shares or 5.9 percent from 7.2 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Cygne said its latest transactions include the sale of 332,500 common shares between Nov 6 and Nov 8 at prices ranging from $19 to $19..50 per share.</p>
<p>AnnTaylor is a national specialty retailer of better quality women's apparel, shoes and accesories sold primarily under the Ann Taylor brand name.</p>
</text>
